# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE RAW SURVEY — NEVER COMMIT THIS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# ECA.xlsx is the anonymous student survey and holds real student names and
# email addresses. It must stay out of the repo:
#
#   1. It is other people's personal data. The site is anonymous by design —
#      publishing the spreadsheet would undo that entirely.
#   2. It would be published to anyone who can clone the repo, forever, in the
#      history, even if deleted in a later commit.
ECA.xlsx
*.xlsx

# Data file src/data/schools.json is committed and edited by hand.

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Vite / tool caches
.vite/
.cache/
coverage/

# NOTE ON _headers and _redirects
#
# public/_headers and public/_redirects are COMMITTED on purpose. They are
# copied verbatim into dist/ and are the Netlify / Cloudflare Pages config for
# cache headers and the SPA rewrite. Deleting them as "generated" would break
# every deploy on those hosts — a refresh of /rankings would 404.
#
# public/sitemap.xml and public/robots.txt are also committed, and are
# generated by `npm run sitemap`. Regenerate them with the real origin
# before launch.
